OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start with a few light
OL,6,Fdrizzly showers. These will fizzle out
OL,7,Fthen some bright spells will develop,
OL,8,Fmainly over Shetland. Light
OL,9,Fnortheasterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FSome brightness over Shetland
OL,12,Fin the evening, otherwise cloudy and
OL,13,Fdry. Orkney will stay cloudy with a
OL,14,Fscattering of showers.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FA dry and bright start over
OL,17,FShetland. Cloud and showers across
OL,18,FOrkney will spread into Shetland in
OL,19,Fthe afternoon. Winds freshening later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
