OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FSunshine and showers on Tuesday. Windy
OL,7,Fwith showers or longer spells of heavy
OL,8,Frain on Wednesday and Thursday.
